resources.string:
Under applicable laws and regulations, you have the following rights:

1. Right to be informed: You have the right to know how this App handles your personal information;
2. Right of access: You can view your photos through the system gallery at any time and check your preferences through the app settings;
3. Right to deletion: You can delete your photos at any time (through the system gallery) or clear app data (through system settings);
4. Right to withdraw consent: You can revoke camera, sensor, and other permissions for this App in system settings at any time;
5. Right to uninstall: You can uninstall this App at any time, and all app private data will be automatically cleared upon uninstallation.
